{% story AboutVarbase with {
  "name": "About Varbase"
} %}

<div class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col">
      <h1>About Varbase Design System</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>A starterkit theme for <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/varbase">Varbase</a> standard websites. A new generation of theming based on <a href="https://getbootstrap.com">Bootstrap 5</a>, Single Directory Components (SDC) with <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/drupal/releases/11.1.6">Drupal ~11</a>, and <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/ui_patterns">UI Patterns</a>.</p>
      <p>Having <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/varbase_components">Varbase Components</a> to provides component management system for <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/varbase">Varbase</a> and <a href="https://www.drupal.org/project/vartheme_bs5">Vartheme BS5</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5">
      <h2>How to use the Vartheme BS5 Starterkit</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <h3>Theme Development Tools</h3>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="https://docs.varbase.vardot.com/v/10.0.x/developers/theme-development-with-varbase/command-to-install-needed-theming-tools">Command to Install Needed Theming Tools</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://docs.varbase.vardot.com/v/10.0.x/developers/theme-development-with-varbase/manually-install-needed-theming-tools">Manually Install Needed Theming Tools</a></li>
      </ol>

      <ul>
        <li>Moved from old ways to new generative ways.</li>
        <li>Use Single Directory Components (SDC) which all components are listed in Varbase Components</li>
        <li>Supporting Storybook in Varbase Projects</li>
        <li>No support for sub-themes, Only Generate your custom cloned theme from the Vartheme BS5 Starter kit.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Do not think of Vartheme BS5 as a base theme, It is a starter kit theme. It has template mapping with Single Directory Components.</p>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5">
      <h2>Theme Development with Varbase</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Following with <a href="https://www.figma.com/design/ARfcW5i5Euid8Yv1QFhgSq/VB---Stylesheet">Varbase Design System</a></p>

      <div style="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;" class="d-grid gap-3">
        <div class="p-4 p-2 bg-light">
          <a href="https://docs.varbase.vardot.com/developers/theme-development-with-varbase/creating-your-own-theme">Creating Your Own Theme</a>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 p-2 bg-light">
          <a href="https://docs.varbase.vardot.com/developers/theme-development-with-varbase/integration-of-varbase-with-storybook-2.0">Integration of Varbase with Storybook</a>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 p-2 bg-light">
          <a href="https://docs.varbase.vardot.com/developers/theme-development-with-varbase/customize-a-varbase-single-directory-components-sdc-in-a-custom-theme">Customize a Varbase Single Directory Components (SDC) In a Custom Theme</a>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 p-2 bg-light">
          <a href="https://docs.varbase.vardot.com/developers/theme-development-with-varbase/add-preloaded-fonts-in-vartheme">Add Preloaded Fonts in Vartheme</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 p-5 bg-light">
    <div class="col">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col pt-3">
          <h2>This theme is best used with <a href="https://drupal.org/project/varbase">Varbase</a> distribution</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row mt-3">
        <div class="col">
          <p>Do not think of Vartheme BS5 as a base theme, It is a starter kit theme. It has template mapping with Single Directory Components.</p>
          <p>However, using it with Varbase gives you way much more cool stuff!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="col pt-5">
      <h3>Varbase documentation</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="row mt-3">
    <div class="col">
      <p>Check out <a href="https://docs.varbase.vardot.com/developers/understanding-varbase/core-components/vartheme-bs5">Varbase documentation</a> for more details.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% endstory %}

{% endstories %}
